From: Scott Miller <152090551+seelesturm@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:37:05 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] fix(gate): report skipped GPU tests and actual adapters

Keep captured test identities and distinguish missing GPU coverage from a successful test process. Keep runner and compute policies unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Coder <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #3879
